{{ang-noun|m|head=swēora}}

# [[neck]]
#* '''c. 900''', [https://archive.org/stream/kingalfredsoros00sweegoog#page/n260/mode/2up translation] of [[w:Orosius|Orosius']] ''History Against the Pagans''
#*: {{quote|ang|Hē oft wȳsċte þæt ealle Rōmāne hæfden ǣnne '''swēoran''', þæt hē hraðost forċeorfan meahte.|He often wished that all of Rome had one '''neck''', so he could cut off all their heads with one blow.}}
# (of water) the part where the distance between two shores is the least

